### Register device 1
POST http://localhost:8080/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "device-01",
  "name": "Lab Device 01"
}


### Register device 2
POST http://localhost:8080/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "device-02",
  "name": "Lab Device 02"
}


### Send heartbeat
POST http://localhost:8080/devices/device-01/heartbeat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timestamp": "2026-09-30T10:30:00Z",
  "status": "OK"
}


### Send heartbeat device 2
POST http://localhost:8080/devices/device-02/heartbeat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timestamp": "2026-09-30T10:30:00Z",
  "status": "OK"
}


### List devices
GET http://localhost:8080/devices


### Get device
GET http://localhost:8080/devices/device-01


### Fleet summary
GET http://localhost:8080/summary
